<MainLayout title="高雄臨時看護接手用餐時段：醫院餐、家屬送餐與飲食指示怎麼核對｜宇涵居家照護" description="高雄臨時看護若在用餐時段接班，家屬應交付當日醫療飲食指示、餐點來源、協助方式、觀察與回報窗口。" keywords="高雄臨時看護,照護知識" ogImage="/images/articles/20260920/yuhan-homecare.webp" ogType="article" canonicalURL="https://yuhanhomecare.com/blog/kaohsiung-temporary-care-mealtime-hospital-family-food-handoff-20260920/" schema={schema}>
  <article>
    <section class="relative bg-[#2b221c] py-16 lg:py-24">
